                                "sense_id": "2785958b-1930-37d7-ac8c-2e9be665e8e2",
                                "text": "the Amphictyonic body"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac70c72a-89c2-437e-9686-873e6e1083e0",
                                "sense_id": "2785958b-1930-37d7-ac8c-2e9be665e8e2",
                                "text": "Of the duties of the Amphictyonic Council nothing will give us a better idea than the oath taken by its members. It ran thus “We will not destroy any Amphictyonic town, nor cut it off from running water in war or peace[…]"
                            }
